Package: grunt-dictation
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Nadeem Shadan <nadeemshadan@outlook.com>
Depends: bash, coreutils, ffmpeg, systemd
Recommends: xdotool, wl-clipboard | xclip, wtype | ydotool, curl | wget, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, python3-gi, libnotify-bin
Description: Grunt — private, offline dictation for Linux
 Standalone speech-to-text for Linux desktops.
 It runs as a user service, records audio, transcribes with whisper.cpp,
 and pastes text into the focused input through the desktop clipboard.
